<title>CHINA: Xinjiang Financial Leasing sets 100 mln yuan bond.</title>
<headline>Xinjiang Financial Leasing sets 100 mln yuan bond.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's Xinjiang Financial Leasing Co is to issue 100 million yuan worth of three-year financial bonds from Wednesday, the Financial Morning Post said on Monday.</p>
</text>
